{"title": "Punch Drunk", "pageid": 11091, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Punch_Drunk", "categories": ["Achievements"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Punch Drunk</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\">achievement</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It requires the player to defeat twenty opponents with a party member who is drunk, in a single playthrough.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">Strategy</span></h2>\n<p>To accumulate kills that count towards this achievement, it is only important for the party member to be drunk during the moment of the killing blow. They can drink any of the <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies#Alcohol\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">alcoholic drinks</a> found in the game before entering combat, or during combat, before they land the killing blow.\n</p><p>An easy way to obtain all needed kills at once is by fighting the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Raven\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/38px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/50px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Raven\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\">Shadow-Cursed Ravens</a> that spawn in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a>. Upon interacting with a dead cursed raven on the ground at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;29&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;118</span>, a large number of cursed ravens begin to spawn, each with only one hit point. They are killed easily en masse by using a lasting area of effect spell such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians\" title=\"Spirit Guardians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/25px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/38px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/50px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spirit Guardians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/25px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians\" title=\"Spirit Guardians\">Spirit Guardians</a>, or by letting them flock towards one target and then using an ability such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/38px-Shatter_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/50px-Shatter_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shatter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp/25px-Shatter_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Shatter_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter</a> for area damage.\n</p><p>A similar opportunity is found in Act Three during the <a href=\"/wiki/Roveer%27s_Storehouse\" title=\"Roveer's Storehouse\">Roveer's Storehouse</a> side quest, where the player is tasked with killing a large number of rats. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202656\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 697/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4517/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 886/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 611992/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.246      1 -total\n 84.12%   11.984      3 Template:Icon_link\n 80.88%   11.522      3 Template:Icon_text\n 68.39%    9.743      1 Template:CharLink\n 68.24%    9.722      6 Template:Trim\n 50.81%    7.238      3 Template:Ifempty\n 28.95%    4.125      2 Template:SAI\n 11.49%    1.637      3 Template:Icon\n  1.87%    0.267      1 Template:Coords\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11091-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202656 and revision id 364678. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}